sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{6}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691246 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691196} {:answer/id #uuid "383361b5-5861-5593-a8c2-48a090500d62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8} + 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691207} {:answer/id #uuid "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1 + \\frac{\\pi}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691217} {:answer/id #uuid "ca073730-27ca-57dd-a298-41b9f5d17dc6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{16}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691239} {:answer/id #uuid "ce6f413c-6d00-5fc7-892c-e68f652ec97a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691240}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691196} :answer-field/id #uuid "e16bf140-48dd-53af-afae-f8f26b57bfd6" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691244}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ef4ff22f-d7cc-5ff1-a8c9-e0c6487fa331" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691249 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3bb114e7-2bfb-530b-97e1-706960c63b4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10} + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691208} {:answer/id #uuid "5e21a22e-b0c2-57a5-a770-7bc3a33f25ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10} + 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691216} {:answer/id #uuid "74e99998-fa45-5d9c-8c34-1ec4f03f4690" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691223} {:answer/id #uuid "77abd06f-5086-54a8-ae6b-ceb7b617ba72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691224} {:answer/id #uuid "7ee8033b-db95-5d8a-8756-c68da261a9de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691226}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ee8033b-db95-5d8a-8756-c68da261a9de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691226} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b1f4898-8933-5ffa-9d32-1b006f6824b5" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 