lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n2 \\pi.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186693061 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6e327aae-c8b7-5e97-8586-a907785ffc46" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693100} {:answer/id #uuid "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693113} {:answer/id #uuid "ccb09420-a5e3-5185-91ab-289df51551ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{20}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693135} {:answer/id #uuid "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693142} {:answer/id #uuid "deecca89-18ce-5d7b-9aec-ec7324047c1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693143}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693113} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5cb26e3-8759-56b5-bb30-313381ee7280" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693130}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{1}{5}}^{0} \\frac{2}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{