$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{12}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186693155 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693149}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693149} :answer-field/id #uuid "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693150}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{0}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186693276 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04f1bee8-5135-51f0-9e8d-a6e53dad5e8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693265} {:answer/id #uuid "517cf536-da92-5faa-b580-365df082c0be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{20}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693275} {:answer/id #uuid "6d37becd-8aa4-5d34-9746-e42bc1ea9d76" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{150}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693279} {:answer/id #uuid "b58d47ec-65e7-5bbc-989e-5f646185864c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693288} {:answer/id #uuid "d7c39e37-d8a8-5df3-85b8-49894475be2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{30}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693292}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d7c39e37-d8a8-5df3-85b8-49894475be2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{30}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693292} :answer-field/id #uuid "43e073aa-87c9-5622-950d-9a94ddd6e3fa" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693273}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "560e2c24-ea3c-532b-8933-02d668239b6e" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{1}{10}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{